Xybrid llama.cpp native bridge: third-party notices

Production decision rendering compiles the following unmodified files from
llama.cpp at commit 8642541b255bfb5dc39cd351a178be09013a55d6:

  common/jinja/{lexer,parser,runtime,value,string}.cpp and their headers
  common/{json,unicode}.cpp and their headers
  vendor/nlohmann/{json,json_fwd}.hpp

The native engine and extended-batch evaluator also link llama.cpp and ggml
from that pin. The renderer does not link the server or chat application.

Redistributed native packages must include both license texts below. This
NOTICE is included in the Rust source crate and is exported as a Bazel input
through //crates/llama-cpp-sys:decision_notices for native package assembly.

